1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Reqix in action: from a real request to an empty state

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
01  Find /api/products in Reqix DevTools

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,800
Click New Rule on the request row, then Modify Response Data

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,800
Add the rule, scoped to the local demo site

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,000
02  Set the response body to {"products":[],"total":0}

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,300
Enable the rule, then save

7
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,900
03  Turn on Reqix in the popup

8
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,700
Reload: the response is empty and the page shows its empty state

9
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,500
Empty state verified; the original API still returns three products

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,000
Get Reqix · reqix-dev.github.io/reqix-website/
